-- adding back log_time_since_enum (the leaking feature) --
  deployed (27 features) : AUC=0.9753  detect=84.2%
  plus the leak (28)     : AUC=0.9765  detect=83.3%
  delta                  : AUC+0.0012  detect-0.8%
  The feature separates every attack class from benign traffic purely
  because post-onset windows are later in a session. Whatever it adds
  is measuring our onset distribution, not the device's behaviour.

